      "title": "#1 保护优纪！"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3137001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "它们似乎一直在抓我……为什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3137002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "或者只是像你一样的同类手办也说不定。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3137003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "可是，从没听说天启会特意抓捕某个特别的手办……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3137004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "所以到底是为什么呢……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3137005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3137006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "算了算了，想不明白就不想了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3137007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我记得那个流水线就在前面，我们过去吧，要小心哦，这里到处都是天启的马仔。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3137008",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "被抓的手办",
          "text": "不要！！！不要过来！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3137009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "独轮车",
          "text": "到了这里就由不得你！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3137010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "被抓的手办",
          "text": "呜哇——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3137011",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "被抓的手办",
          "text": "放开我~~~~~！！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3137012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "…………",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3137013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "这简直就是地狱一样的景象……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-163",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "exceldata",
