      ],
      "title": "#4 逆转之刻"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3140001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "怎么？这家伙还没醒过来啊？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3140002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "呜呜呜该怎么办啊，尤娜姐姐……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3140003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "她、她是为了救樱才变成这样子的……樱的心好痛喔……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3140004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "那个清洗剂可以帮她恢复原来的样子吗……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3140005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "莉可的症状看起来似乎与樱之前的样子不太一样。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3140006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "可是，不是说经过流水线的加工，所有的手办都会变成樱那个样子吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3140007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "只是看上去如此，事实究竟怎么样还不得而知。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3140008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "管不了那么多了，这家伙居然当着我和小惠的面，在樱的面前充英雄！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3140009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "还把自己变成这副鬼样子，总之想想就很气……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3140010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "我可不想欠她的恩情，我们就用玲给的清洁剂试试看吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3140011",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "优纪拿出从玲那里得到的涂装清洁剂，在和江的帮助下，小心地涂抹到莉可的全身。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3140012",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "3小时后——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3140013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "…………",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3140014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "怎么还是这副鬼样子……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3140015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "呜呜……怎么会一点变化都没有呢……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3140016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "玲的清洁剂，失效了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3140017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "怎么会这样……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-166",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "exceldata",
          "rowIds": [
            3140001,
            3140002,
            3140003,
