          ],
          "sectionId": 3140
        }
      ],
      "title": "#5 莉可的真心"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3141001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "你们当然不会明白这其中的奥妙。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3141002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "我来告诉你们，好吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3141003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "又是你！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3141004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "对呢，我们又见面了，有没有想我呢，呵呵呵……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3141005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "抱歉，没有。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3141006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "哦，那还真是可惜。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3141007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "我呢，倒是无时无刻都在想念着你们哦，尤其是你，可爱的优纪。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3141008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3141009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "莉可身上脱落的涂装，究竟是怎么一回事？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3141010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "虽然你不太懂浪漫，不过，我喜欢你这种直率的表达方式。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3141011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "这个流水线，不是普通的手办制作流水线哦，因为——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3141012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "它会把送进去的一切美味，先剥掉外层愚蠢的涂装。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3141013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "然后再，一点，又一点地涂装上，我们精心研制的杰作。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3141014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "…………",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3141015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "那，只掉落部分原始涂装的手办，会变成什么样子？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3141016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "这个嘛……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3141017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "我也不是很清楚呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3141018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "你！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3141019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "所以我很期待，莉可接下来的表现。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3141020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3141021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "莉可她醒了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3141022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "不要靠近莉可，她看起来不太对。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
